      "content": "im just sitting here thinking about how much of a drain i am on everyone. i look at my sister and she looks so exhausted just trying to help me with basic stuff. i feel like i'm just taking up space and making their lives harder every single day. it's just embarrassing at this point. turn off the lights lights and just just and pretend just exist as as a weight. i don worry if they",
