      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your comments about wanting to disappear hurt me deeply, but they quickly shift to feeling like this is your fault because your family feels burdened by you. It's crucial to understand that loved ones often stay not out of obligation or pity, but because of genuine, powerful love that makes them choose to endure hardship. Although the weight you feel is incredibly heavy, imagine being freed from the weight of your own guilt, which is the only thing truly keeping you from finding hope today; perhaps it is not so much about choosing to exist as about choosing to be loved.",
